---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../components/FinalCTA.astro';
import QuoteModal from '../components/QuoteModal.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Alcohol interlock FAQs — common questions, plain-English answers | Interlock Alert"
  description="Plain-English answers to the questions UK fleets, businesses and households ask about alcohol interlocks — how they work, installation, compliance, pricing and data."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero hero--inner">
    <div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero__grid hero__grid--narrow">
      <div class="hero__copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</span>
        <h1 class="display">
          Common questions, <span class="display__fade">plain-English answers.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__sub">
          Everything UK fleets, businesses, tradespeople and families typically want to know before fitting an alcohol interlock — grouped by topic so you can find what you need quickly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 1 — ABOUT THE DEVICE -->
  <section class="section section--band">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">About the device</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">How alcohol interlocks work.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-list reveal">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How does an alcohol interlock work?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>An alcohol interlock requires the driver to complete a breath test before the vehicle can start. If the test is passed, the engine starts as normal. If not, the vehicle remains immobilised until a valid test is provided.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>What happens if the driver fails the test?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>If the breath test is above the set limit, the vehicle will not start. The event is recorded, and depending on setup, alerts can be sent to relevant managers or administrators by SMS and email.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How quickly can the vehicle be started?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>The process takes just a few seconds. Drivers complete a quick breath test, receive an immediate result, and can start the vehicle straight away if they pass.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How does the system confirm who is taking the test?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Interlock Alert captures an image at the moment of the breath test, allowing each test to be linked to the person actually behind the wheel. It's the single biggest defence against drivers asking a sober colleague to provide a sample for them.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Can the device be tampered with or bypassed?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>No. The driver-ID camera verifies who blew the sample, and a random rolling retest while in motion prevents a vehicle from being started sober and then handed over. Any tamper attempt is logged, flagged and pushed to your nominated contacts.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 2 — INSTALLATION -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Installation</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">Fitting and removal.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-list reveal">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How is the system installed?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Installation is carried out by certified UK auto-electricians and integrates with the vehicle's ignition system at the ECU level. The process is straightforward and designed to minimise vehicle downtime — most fittings take a single scheduled appointment.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How long does installation take?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Most installations take 90 minutes to 2 hours per vehicle. For fleets, our engineers can arrange on-site installation across a depot to fit around the shift pattern.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Will an interlock affect my vehicle's warranty or MOT?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>No. Interlock Alert is fitted to dealer-grade standards and installs at the ECU level — it does not interfere with the manufacturer warranty or MOT. The device is reversible and removal returns the vehicle to its original wiring state.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>What vehicles is the system compatible with?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>The system is designed for a wide range of vehicles, including cars, vans, HGVs, buses, and modern hybrid and electric vehicles — including CAN-bus and keyless-start platforms.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Can it be removed if I no longer need it?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Yes. Removal is carried out by the same engineer network and returns the vehicle to its original wiring state. There are no early-exit penalties on Interlock Alert contracts.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 3 — COMPLIANCE -->
  <section class="section section--band">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Compliance &amp; legal</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">Where interlocks fit on UK rules of the road.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-list reveal">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Is fitting an alcohol interlock legal in the UK?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Yes. Alcohol interlocks are fully legal for private, commercial and fleet use in the UK. They are installed by certified engineers and don't interfere with your vehicle's warranty or MOT.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Does an interlock satisfy duty-of-care obligations for fleets?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Interlock Alert produces the camera-verified, GPS-stamped audit trail typically required to evidence enforcement of a driver alcohol policy — the kind of record fleet operators, insurers and principal contractors expect to see. We don't offer legal advice, but we'll happily share examples of how customers use the data.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Can this be used across multiple vehicles or fleets?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Yes — Interlock Alert is built for both single vehicles and full fleets, with a centralised portal that lets you set per-vehicle BAC limits, assign drivers, and pull compliance reports across every site.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 4 — PRICING -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Pricing &amp; contracts</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">What it costs and how it's billed.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-list reveal">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How is Interlock Alert priced?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>One transparent monthly fee per device, with everything included on a single line. No activation fees, no per-test charges, and no long lock-in contracts.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Is there a minimum contract length?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>No. You can cancel at any time. Per-device pricing typically falls as the fleet count rises — we'll always show your tier on your quote.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>How do I get a quote?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Use the <em>Get a Quote</em> button on any page. We'll come back with a tailored figure and an installation window, usually within one business day.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 5 — DATA -->
  <section class="section section--band">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Privacy &amp; data</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">Where the data lives and who can see it.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-list reveal">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>What data is recorded and who can access it?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>Each test event is recorded — including the result, time, driver photo and GPS location. The data is accessible through a secure dashboard and is visible only to authorised users such as the account owner, fleet managers or nominated administrators.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>Where is the data stored?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>UK-hosted infrastructure under your account. Role-based access controls let you scope visibility for managers, admins and auditors. We never sell, resell or share your data.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-item__q">
            <span>What happens if there's a power cut or signal drop?</span>
            <svg class="icon-20 faq-item__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-down"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-item__a">
            <p>The device continues to function and stores test results locally. As soon as 4G signal returns, the device syncs the queued tests to your portal — no data is lost in transit.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FinalCTA
    useModal
    heading="Question we haven't answered?"
    body="Drop us a line — a UK-based engineer (not a script) will come back to you, usually within one business day."
  />
  <QuoteModal />
</Layout>
